## Zemberek entries akana drops (matched on word, POS and secondary POS). Each one has a
## replacement in akana-legal.dict or is a POS error with no replacement needed.
## Nisba adjectives Zemberek lists without a POS, so they were read as nouns.
idarî
kanunî
ihtiyatî
tıbbî
fizikî
vicdanî
hususî
ziraî
içtimaî
hakikî
ihtiyarî
ulusal
## sulh takes front-vowel suffixes (sulhe, sulhü); replaced with InverseHarmony.
sulh
